8","id":3032164418,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60uyhC","user":{"login":"Nikitf777","id":127026067,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5JDkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127026067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777","html_url":"https://github.com/Nikitf777","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T12:54:28Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T12:54:28Z","body":"> Is this feature inspired by some existing app? Never seen tabs that work like this.\r\n\r\nThe only thing that comes to my mind right now is Libreoffice Writer:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c4c546e-8cda-4e5d-aa25-1620d6b25615\r\n\r\nBut this is a very bad example, because the buttons are located far from each other and because you can't scroll with mousewheel.\r\nThis idea came to me when I tried Godot on my phone recently (it wasn't the first time I tried it, but previously I didn't know how to improve it). I just immidiately though that it should switch tabs instead of scrolling because it was annoying to scroll with buttons and then also clicking to the tab I want. It just requires more actions to do the same thing. And also I want (and probably will) use it it my own game (regardless of the success of merging this PR)\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032164418/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]